# Normalize text to LF inside the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixture data is byte-sensitive: the brief requires stating
#   shasum -a 256 fixtures/event_sample.jsonl
# and Git's autocrlf on Windows silently rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout,
# which changes that hash (5749 bytes LF vs 5774 bytes CRLF for this file).
# `-text` disables all line-ending translation so the checksum reproduces
# byte-identically on Windows, macOS, and Linux.
# NOTE: last matching pattern wins, so this must stay below the `*` rule.
*.jsonl -text